{"name": "s1", "dur": 40.15, "lines": [{"id": "p01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.93, "clip": 0.3, "text": "你发出去的每张照片，", "ch": [0.35, 0.508, 0.666, 0.824, 0.982, 1.14, 1.298, 1.456, 1.614, 1.772], "sub": null, "big": "你发出去的每张照片，", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p02", "t0": 2.33, "t1": 3.8, "clip": 2.27, "text": "在芯片之间都要跑一趟。", "ch": [2.33, 2.464, 2.597, 2.731, 2.865, 2.998, 3.132, 3.265, 3.399, 3.533, 3.666], "sub": null, "big": "在芯片之间都要跑一趟。", "seg": "open", "src": ""}, {"id": "p03", "t0": 4.2, "t1": 7.56, "clip": 4.14, "text": "直觉上，修几十条路，把照片切成几十条一起送，最快。", "ch": [4.2, 4.334, 4.469, 4.603, 4.738, 4.872, 5.006, 5.141, 5.275, 5.41, 5.544, 5.678, 5.813, 5.947, 6.082, 6.216, 6.35, 6.485, 6.619, 6.754, 6.888, 7.022, 7.157, 7.291, 7.426], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "p04", "t0": 7.81, "t1": 11.67, "clip": 7.76, "text": "慢的时候确实没问题：每一条都按时到，照片拼得严丝合缝。", "ch": [7.81, 7.929, 8.048, 8.167, 8.286, 8.405, 8.524, 8.643, 8.762, 8.881, 9.17, 9.301, 9.432, 9.564, 9.695, 9.826, 9.957, 10.089, 10.32, 10.47, 10.62, 10.77, 10.92, 11.07, 11.22, 11.37, 11.52], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": ""}, {"id": "p05", "t0": 12.12, "t1": 17.47, "clip": 12.06, "text": "可速度一快，一张紧跟着一张；哪条路长了一点点，那一条就晚到半步，拼进了下一张。", "ch": [12.12, 12.257, 12.394, 12.532, 12.669, 12.806, 12.943, 13.08, 13.217, 13.355, 13.492, 13.629, 13.766, 13.903, 14.041, 14.178, 14.315, 14.452, 14.589, 14.726, 14.864, 15.001, 15.138, 15.275, 15.412, 15.549, 15.687, 15.824, 15.961, 16.098, 16.235, 16.373, 16.51, 16.647, 16.784, 16.921, 17.058, 17.196, 17.333], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p06", "t0": 18.62, "t1": 19.4, "clip": 18.57, "text": "照片就成了这样。", "ch": [18.62, 18.718, 18.815, 18.913, 19.01, 19.108, 19.205, 19.303], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p07", "t0": 19.65, "t1": 23.36, "clip": 19.58, "text": "聊天、转账也一样：没有纠错的话，错一位，意思就全变了。", "ch": [19.65, 19.787, 19.925, 20.062, 20.2, 20.337, 20.474, 20.612, 20.749, 20.887, 21.024, 21.161, 21.299, 21.436, 21.574, 21.711, 21.849, 21.986, 22.123, 22.261, 22.398, 22.536, 22.673, 22.81, 22.948, 23.085, 23.223], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p08", "t0": 23.61, "t1": 25.69, "clip": 23.54, "text": "路越多，越难让每一条都一样长。", "ch": [23.61, 23.749, 23.887, 24.026, 24.165, 24.303, 24.442, 24.581, 24.719, 24.858, 24.997, 25.135, 25.274, 25.413, 25.551], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p09", "t0": 26.14, "t1": 32.45, "clip": 26.08, "text": "所以最快的芯片反过来：只修几条路，让数据排成一队，一个接一个跑。不用等谁，就能越跑越快。", "ch": [26.14, 26.283, 26.427, 26.57, 26.714, 26.857, 27.0, 27.144, 27.287, 27.431, 27.574, 27.718, 27.861, 28.004, 28.148, 28.291, 28.435, 28.578, 28.721, 28.865, 29.008, 29.152, 29.295, 29.438, 29.582, 29.725, 29.869, 30.012, 30.155, 30.299, 30.442, 30.586, 30.729, 30.873, 31.016, 31.159, 31.303, 31.446, 31.59, 31.733, 31.876, 32.02, 32.163, 32.307], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": ""}, {"id": "p10", "t0": 32.9, "t1": 33.65, "clip": 32.84, "text": "一句话带走：", "ch": [32.9, 33.025, 33.15, 33.275, 33.4, 33.525], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "p11", "t0": 33.9, "t1": 35.13, "clip": 33.85, "text": "路少，反而不会乱。", "ch": [33.9, 34.03, 34.16, 34.43, 34.547, 34.663, 34.78, 34.897, 35.013], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}, {"id": "p12", "t0": 35.38, "t1": 38.55, "clip": 35.31, "text": "下一条：排成一队以后，对面怎么知道数到了第几个？", "ch": [35.38, 35.488, 35.595, 35.703, 36.01, 36.13, 36.25, 36.37, 36.49, 36.61, 36.73, 36.97, 37.092, 37.213, 37.335, 37.456, 37.578, 37.699, 37.821, 37.942, 38.064, 38.185, 38.307, 38.428], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": ""}], "shots": [{"kind": "photo", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "p01", "t1": 3.9}, {"kind": "strips", "t0": 3.9, "paper": false, "first": "p03", "t1": 25.84}, {"kind": "serial", "t0": 25.84, "paper": false, "first": "p09", "t1": 32.6}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 32.6, "paper": true, "first": "p10", "type": [{"text": "一句话带走", "line": "p10", "from": null, "to": null}, {"text": "路少，", "line": "p11", "from": "路少", "to": "路少"}, {"text": "反而不会乱。", "line": "p11", "from": "反而", "to": "不会乱"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 40.15}], "hudIn": 3.9}